#    the customer's own coordinates), geographic reports (per zone/neighborhood
#    counts, unassigned, per-rep workload & density, 30-day coverage
#    comparison, per-street counts) and the provenance-labeled data browser
#  * CustomersTab: structured neighborhood/street pickers (city-gated) +
