--- a/src/lib/geo-mashhad.ts	1970-01-01 00:00:00.000000000 +0000
+++ b/src/lib/geo-mashhad.ts	2026-11-18 07:18:05.551246953 +0000
@@ -0,0 +1,760 @@
+/**
+ * Mashhad structured geography — GENERATED SEED DATASET (Phase 5 / فاز پنج).
+ *
+ * DO NOT HAND-EDIT — regenerate with tools/geo-mashhad/build-dataset.py
+ * (raw Overpass extracts live in tools/geo-mashhad/raw/; the official
+ * 13-zone lists are embedded in that script, with sources).
+ *
+ * Sources (both DATED, recorded per node in the DB seed):
+ *  - zones & official neighborhood lists: مصوبه شورای اسلامی شهر مشهد ۱۹۶۶۳/۹۶/۵/ش — مرزبندی ۱۳گانه (mashhad-city.ir/mahale170، بازیابی ۱۴۰۵-۰۸-۲۷)
+ *  - coordinates & streets: © OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL) — استخراج Overpass 2026-11-18
+ *
+ * Accuracy notes (deliberate, honest):
+ *  - neighborhood coordinates are place-node CENTROIDS, not boundaries;
+ *    «auto-detect from coordinates» = nearest centroid within a documented
+ *    radius — an approximation, labeled as such in the UI.
+ *  - OSM-only neighborhoods carry zone=null (no fabricated zone mapping);
+ *    they surface in reports under «بدون محدوده».
+ *  - streets are city-level (a street spans neighborhoods; no fake
+ *    street→neighborhood assignment is made).
+ */
+
